@startuml rendering-pipeline-flowchart-gpu-backbuffer
title Desktop GPU: immutable RenderFrameSnapshot mailbox
|Engine thread|
start
repeat
:Simulation / background work;
if (Foreground frame due at TargetFPS?) then (yes)
:Update effects and DirectDrawings;
:Acquire free slot (three total);
:Resolve views, visibility, ordering, frames, geometry;
:Record CPU commands, overlays and post-scene hooks;
:Publish completed RenderFrameSnapshot;
:Recycle replaced unacquired snapshot;
:AfterFrameRender requests repaint;
endif
repeat while (Engine running?)
stop
|GL callback|
start
:EnsureInitialized with current GRContext;
note right: Only size notification briefly synchronizes live viewports.
:Acquire latest completed snapshot;
if (Matching logical dimensions?) then (yes)
:Replay immutable commands to GpuBackbuffer;
:EndFrame / GPU snapshot;
:Release snapshot slot;
else (no new frame)
:Reuse current GPU backbuffer;
endif
:Present with existing transform and sampling;
:Flush / RecordFrame;
stop
@enduml
